# Regenerable discovery-factory outputs: per-spec verdict JSONs, the racy
# LEADERBOARD aggregate, and scratch run logs. Reproduce with
#   python -m backtest.discovery_factory [--symbol ... --interval ...]
# FINDINGS.md -- the curated, synthesized deliverable -- is the ONLY tracked
# artifact here (it is not matched by these patterns).
*.json
*.err
*.log
# Staged deep-history caches (lever 3): large resampled/copied CSVs, regenerable
# via backtest.resample_intraday -- never committed.
_deep15m_cache/
!.gitignore
